  - m_Id: 16436779487247
    m_Localized: "The Ancestors\u2019 Shirt"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 16436779487248
    m_Localized: "The Beer Shield\u2019s Armour"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 16436779487249
    m_Localized: "The Stone Blood\u2019s Cuirass"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 16436779487250
    m_Localized: "The Dragon Spawn\u2019s Breastplate"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 16436779487251
    m_Localized: "\u2018I Won\u2019t Fall\u2019 Boots"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 16436779487252
    m_Localized: Shod Hooves
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 16436779487253
    m_Localized: Earthquake Boots
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17363162828800
    m_Localized: Stone Heart Ring
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 21551762575360
    m_Localized: Coin
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 21551787741184
    m_Localized: Exp
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 21551787741185
    m_Localized: "A huge two-handed hammer. The handle is engraved with the words
      \u2018If you love me, give it a knock\u2019."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 21551787741186
    m_Localized: Lightweight, yet deadly. They say it can settle not only an orc,
      but also a tavern brawl in a flash.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 21551787741187
    m_Localized: The dwarves show it off to the humans.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 21551787741188
    m_Localized: "The blade is covered in nicks and teeth marks. \u2018He almost
      killed a dragon\u2026 almost.\u2019"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 21551787741189
    m_Localized: Simple, reliable, a bit on the heavy side.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 21551791935488
    m_Localized: Makes the wearer a little more stubborn. Sometimes a bit too much.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 21551791935489
    m_Localized: Sometimes it reveals the terrifying depths of a tale rather than
      dreams.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 21551791935490
    m_Localized: "Not a weapon. Just a talisman. Brings good luck\u2026 sometimes."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 21551791935491
    m_Localized: "It glows with a soft blue light. The dwarves are convinced it\u2019s
      a piece of a real star. The elves call it a \u2018meteorite\u2019. The dwarves
      beat them up."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 21551791935492
    m_Localized: "You\u2019ll never tire of running"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 21551791935493
    m_Localized: Hands work faster.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 21551791935494
    m_Localized: The Black Breath of the Earth
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 21551791935495
    m_Localized: The Blood of the Young Mountain
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 21551791935496
    m_Localized: Shards of Magical Ice
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 21551791935497
    m_Localized: Stars Buried in Stone
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 21551791935498
    m_Localized: The Tears of Greedy Gods
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 21551791935499
    m_Localized: The Bones of the Ancients
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 21551791935500
    m_Localized: Black and dense could be used as a weapon in a pinch.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 21551791935501
    m_Localized: A classic.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 21551791935502
    m_Localized: "After the second slice, you start to see the \u2018spirits of your
      ancestors\u2019"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 21551791935503
    m_Localized: Rabbit and lots and lots and lots of spices.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 21551791935504
    m_Localized: "\"Yes, it\u2019s literally a bucket. But a very sturdy one. Boromir
      even used it to cook soup.\""
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 21551791935505
    m_Localized: A heavy helmet with a hammer engraved on the forehead. Legend has
      it that it was once struck by lightning. Now, its owner sometimes hears the
      approving grumbling of his ancestors.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 21551791935506
    m_Localized: "A simple but sturdy helmet with horns. \"The dwarves say the horns
      aren\u2019t just for show, but to make it easier to grip the rocks in the mine.\""
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 21551791935507
    m_Localized: Made from the scales of a young dragon that the dwarves "accidentally"
      found in a mine. It smells of sulphur and pride.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 21551791935508
    m_Localized: The ground trembles slightly with every step. Perfect for scaring
      the elves.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 21551791935509
    m_Localized: Forged from iron veined with red quartz. It looks as though molten
      stone is flowing from the chest.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 21551791935510
    m_Localized: "Decorated with an image of a mug. \u2018As long as you\u2019re
      drinking, you\u2019re invincible. After the fifth mug, you\u2019re immortal
      (in your own eyes).\u2019"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 21551791935511
    m_Localized: The soles are fitted with real iron spikes. The dwarves claim this
      is for better grip on stone. In reality, they just love to stomp about loudly.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 21551791935512
    m_Localized: A chainmail shirt, with a small stone bearing the name of an ancestor
      fused into each link. Very heavy. Very noisy. Very dwarven.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 21551791935513
    m_Localized: "Extremely durable. Even when you\u2019re really tired, you\u2019ll
      stay on your feet. Tested by several generations."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 21551791935514
    m_Localized: Coin - money.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 21551791935515
    m_Localized: exp
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  references:
    version: 2
    RefIds: []
